<mjml lang="en-AU">
  <mj-head>
    <mj-title>Helen, your $1,610 rebate spot is still open</mj-title>
    <mj-preview>Your price could be $2,188 after the rebate. Saving your spot takes a few seconds.</mj-preview>
    <mj-include path="./partials/head.mjml" />
  </mj-head>
  <mj-body>
    <mj-wrapper css-class="card">
      <mj-include path="./partials/header.mjml" />

      <mj-section>
        <mj-column>
          <mj-text mj-class="h1" css-class="email-heading">Helen, your $1,610 rebate spot is still open</mj-text>
          <mj-text>A couple of days ago we sent your ceiling insulation estimate. Nothing has changed: the $1,610 Victorian Energy Upgrades rebate is still available and your spot is still open.</mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <mj-section>
        <mj-column mj-class="panel-mint">
          <mj-text mj-class="eyebrow center" padding="18px 12px 6px">Your estimated rebate</mj-text>
          <mj-text mj-class="big-green" padding="0 12px 18px">You save $1,610</mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <mj-section>
        <mj-column mj-class="panel">
          <mj-text mj-class="eyebrow center" padding="18px 12px 6px">You pay after the rebate</mj-text>
          <mj-text mj-class="big-blue">$2,188</mj-text>
          <mj-text mj-class="center" font-size="14px" line-height="20px" font-weight="700">incl. GST · full price <span class="strike">$3,798</span></mj-text>
          <mj-text mj-class="small center" padding="0 16px 18px">Based on what you told us: 137 m² ceiling, no existing insulation.<br /><a href="https://estimate.homeinsulationvictoria.com.au/estimate/TEST/calculator" style="color:#3C51C4;font-weight:700;">Try a different ceiling size</a></mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <mj-section>
        <mj-column>
          <mj-text mj-class="h2" css-class="email-sub" padding="18px 12px 6px">Save your spot – it's free</mj-text>
          <mj-text>Thousands of Victorians have registered. Spots are released in the order they were saved. It takes a few seconds. No payment, no obligation.</mj-text>
          <mj-button href="https://estimate.homeinsulationvictoria.com.au/estimate/TEST/campaign">Save my free spot</mj-button>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <mj-section>
        <mj-column>
          <mj-text mj-class="small" padding="4px 12px 0">Questions? Just reply to this email.</mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <mj-include path="./partials/footer-owner.mjml" />
    </mj-wrapper>
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
